or\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">xargs</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-0</span> dos2unix</code></pre></div>\n<h2>After</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">$ <span class=\"token function\">vi</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span> <span class=\"token function\">file</span>\nThis is a <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">test</span></code></pre></div>","timeToRead":1,"frontmatter":{"title":"Remove Control-M symbols from files on Mac","date":"November 24, 2023","description":null,"tags":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/vite-test-package-vitest/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"How to Test Vite + React application (Vitest)"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"a551b07e-0785-5af9-a3bb-6de9162c5b58","previousPostId":"0351a350-56f5-50e2-a8b4-d070897837bb","nextPostId":null}},"staticQueryHashes":["3351346743","3517523002","4021987012"]}